We need correct SMILES for target. Use the mapped_rxn product: '[CH3:1][c:2]4[cH:7][cH:6][c:5]([NH:8][S:9](=[O:10])([c:12]5[cH:17][cH:16][c:15](/[CH:18]=[CH:19]/[C:20]([NH:28][c:26]6[c:25]([NH2:29])[cH:24][cH:23][cH:22][cH:27]6)=[O:21])[cH:14][cH:13]5)=[O:11])[cH:4][cH:3]4'

