But need correct aromatic notation: [c] is aromatic carbon. Use lower case c. So final SMILES: Cc1ccc... Actually maybe easier: Use the product SMILES from mapped_rxn but strip mapping numbers and keep aromatic. Let's manually edit:

Original: [CH3:1][c:2]4[cH:7][cH:6][c:5]([NH:8][S:9](=[O:10])([c:12]5[cH:17][cH:16][c:15](/[CH:18]=[CH:19]/[C:20]([NH:28][c:26]6[c:25]([NH2:29])[cH:24][cH:23][cH:22][cH:27]6)=[O:21])[cH:14][cH:13]5)=[O:11])[cH:4][cH:3]4

